@startuml flow-stream
' Rendered with: java -jar plantuml.jar -tsvg -o . docs/flow-stream.puml
title Streaming a screen that mostly does not change

!include style.iuml

participant "app under\ncontrol" as A
participant "bridge app" as B
participant "server" as S

B -[#C0391B]> S : WebSocket connect, then hello
note right of B
  The phone dials out, so it needs
  no inbound address.
end note

loop every content change, at most one dump per 300 ms
  A -> B : accessibility tree, one IPC per node
  B -> B : walk it, hashing each node's fields
  alt the hash differs from the last push
    B -[#C0391B]> S : tree: nodes, windows, truncation flag
  else unchanged
    B -> B : nothing serialized, nothing sent
  end
end

@enduml
